<title>USA: Kansas feedlot cattle market at standstill - USDA.</title>
<headline>Kansas feedlot cattle market at standstill - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DODGE CITY 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was quiet, with no sales slaughter steers or heifers confirmed, USDA said. Inquiry and demand light. Sales confirmed for the week on 67,200 cattle including 14,600 head or about 22 percent previously contracted or formulated cattle. Confirmed - none   last week - none   last year - 50</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
